# Firmware Version Stamp Rule

When editing firmware sketches under `esp32-firmware/`, always update the first line version stamp:

`//verX.Y M/D/YYYY HH:MM`

Requirements:
- Increment `X.Y` for each firmware change.
- Set date/time to the current local time of the edit.
- Keep the same updated first line in both files:
  - `esp32-firmware/CarTracker.ino`
  - `C:\Users\User\OneDrive\Documents\Arduino\Car Tracker\CarTracker\CarTracker.ino`

Do not finish the task if the two first-line stamps are not identical.
